    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set sail for a unique puzzle adventure!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>We're in the Same Boat</i>, you'll help a crew of quirky animal characters navigate tricky river crossings. But these aren't your ordinary crossings! Each challenge comes with a riddle that unveils the special rule each animal must follow. Can you crack the code and get everyone safely across?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brain-teasing puzzles: Solve for the optimal crossing order using logic and the hidden rule revealed in each riddle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable animal crew: Meet a cast of charming animals, each with their own personality and unique rule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing challenges: Progress through increasingly difficult levels that will test your wit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun for all ages: The simple yet engaging gameplay is perfect for casual players and puzzle enthusiasts alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, even if you're in different boats! Download &quot;We're in the Same Boat&quot; and embark on a delightful journey of riddles and river crossings!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set sail for a unique puzzle adventure!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>We're in the Same Boat</i>, you'll help a crew of quirky animal characters navigate tricky river crossings. But these aren't your ordinary crossings! Each challenge comes with a riddle that unveils the special rule each animal must follow. Can you crack the code and get everyone safely across?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brain-teasing puzzles: Solve for the optimal crossing order using logic and the hidden rule revealed in each riddle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adorable animal crew: Meet a cast of charming animals, each with their own personality and unique rule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever-changing challenges: Progress through increasingly difficult levels that will test your wit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun for all ages: The simple yet engaging gameplay is perfect for casual players and puzzle enthusiasts alike.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together, even if you're in different boats! Download &quot;We're in the Same Boat&quot; and embark on a delightful journey of riddles and river crossings!</p>",
    "short_description": "In We're in the Same Boat, guide a quirky crew of animals across rivers, solving riddles to uncover unique rules for each character. Use logic to crack the code and complete increasingly tricky levels. Fun, charming, and brain-teasing!",
